{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-8-1","title":"Psalms 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God's glory is magnified by his works, and by his love to man.</p>\n<p>(Title.) Gittith. 81:1; 84:1; *titles our. 9; 63:1; 145:1; Isa 26:13; Mt 22:45; Joh 20:28; Php 2:11; 3:8 Re 19:6 how. 72:17-19; 113:2-4; 148:13; Ex 15:11; 34:5-7; De 28:58; So 5:16 thy. 36:5; 57:10,11; 68:4; 108:4,5; 1Ki 8:27; Hab 3:3; Eph 4:10 Php 2:9,10; Heb 7:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-8-2","title":"Psalms 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Out. Mt 11:25; 21:16; Lu 10:21; 1Co 1:27 ordained. Heb. founded. strength. 84:5-7; Isa 40:31; Am 5:9; 2Co 12:9,10 still. 4:4; 46:10; Ex 11:7; 15:16; Jos 2:9-11; 1Sa 2:9; Isa 37:20-29,36-38 Hab 2:20 the enemy. 44:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-8-3","title":"Psalms 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>When. 19:1; 111:2; Job 22:12; 36:24; Ro 1:20 work. 33:6; Ge 1:1; Ex 8:19; 31:18; Lu 11:20 moon. 104:19; 136:7-9; 148:3; Ge 1:16-18; De 4:19; Job 25:3,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-8-4","title":"Psalms 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>What. 144:3; 2Ch 6:18; Job 7:17; 25:6; Isa 40:17; Heb 2:6-9 son. 4:2; 80:17; 146:3; Isa 51:12; Eze 8:15; Mt 8:20 visitest. 106:4; Ge 21:1; Ex 4:31; Lu 1:68; 19:44; 1Pe 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-8-5","title":"Psalms 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thou. 103:20; Ge 1:26,27; 2:7; 2Sa 14:29; Job 4:18-20; Php 2:7,8 Heb 2:7,9,16 hast. 21:3-5; 45:1-3,6; Joh 13:31,32; Eph 1:21; Php 2:9-11; Heb 2:9 1Pe 1:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-8-6","title":"Psalms 8:6","auth